{
  "slug": "akii-seo-ai-search-optimizer",
  "name": "Akii Seo Ai Search Optimizer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Free SEO, AEO, and GEO toolkit by Akii. Audit websites, plan content strategy, optimize pages, generate schema markup, cluster keywords, and track AI visibility across ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity, Copilot, and Google AI Overviews — all from your terminal or IDE.\n\nShips 15 model-invoked skills (auto-trigger from natural language), 5 autonomous agents, and 8 slash commands. Encodes per-engine algorithm signal weights (ChatGPT 41% authoritative lists, Gemini 49% Google lists + 3.5★ review cutoff, Perplexity 64% top-5 lists, Claude 68% trusted business databases) and the Princeton/IIT-Delhi/Allen Institute GEO method (validated +40% AI visibility lift; +97–115% for pages ranked outside top 5).\n\nAuto-detects user's existing Ahrefs, Google Search Console, DataForSEO, and Apify MCPs for richer real-data outputs; falls back to WebFetch and WebSearch when not available. No login. No usage cap. No external dependencies — every skill works standalone via Claude Code's built-in tools.\n\nThe /ai-visibility-score command returns a real 0–100 score across four dimensions (Brand Recognition, Brand Understanding, Content Coverage, Brand Sentiment) via the same workflow that powers akii.com — no signup required.\n\nMIT licensed.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**, **5 agents**, **8 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `aeo-optimization` (Restructure content for Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) — direct-answer leads, autonomous sections, definition blocks, FAQ schema, 5–7 step…), `ai-visibility` (Analyze and improve how a brand appears in AI-generated responses (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity, Copilot, Google AI Overviews)), `ai-visibility-score` (Get a brand's real Akii AI Visibility Score (0–100) with four-dimension breakdown — Brand Recognition, Brand Understanding, Content…), `broken-links` (Find and fix broken internal and external links on a website or in a codebase), `content-brief` (Generate a detailed content brief for a specific article or page), `content-strategy` (Develop a content strategy for SEO and organic growth), `content-translation` (Translate and localize content for international SEO), `geo-optimization` (Rewrite content using empirically-validated GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) tactics from the Princeton/IIT Delhi/Allen Institute study — citation integration,…), and 7 more\n- **Agents** (5): `ai-visibility-analyzer` (Autonomously analyze a brand's presence across ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity, Copilot, and Google AI Overviews and produce a…), `competitor-analyzer` (Analyze competitors' SEO, AEO, GEO, and AI visibility), `content-strategist` (Analyze a website and create a complete content strategy), `schema-generator` (Generate, audit, and validate JSON-LD structured data autonomously across one or many pages), `seo-auditor` (Run a full SEO + AEO + GEO audit on a website or codebase)\n- **Commands** (8): `ai-visibility-score` (Get a real Akii AI Visibility Score (0–100) with 4-dimension breakdown for any domain — same workflow as…), `create-content` (Generate SEO + AEO + GEO-optimized content for a topic or keyword), `create-topic` (Research and generate a complete topic plan with keyword mapping, audience, angle, and competitive positioning), `generate-llms-txt` (Generate llms.txt (and optional llms-full.txt) for AI crawler discovery), `generate-schema` (Generate JSON-LD structured data / schema markup for a page), `keyword-cluster` (Cluster a list of keywords into topical groups mapped to pillar + cluster pages), `seo-check` (Quick SEO + AEO check on the current file or a specified page), `translate-content` (Translate and localize content with per-locale keyword research, hreflang, and cultural adaptation)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install akii-seo-ai-search-optimizer@claude-community` from `akii-technologies-ltd/akii-seo-ai-search-optimizer`.",
